  <body sectionsNumbered="yes" xml:id="tst10101-body-0001">
    <section xml:id="tst10101-sec-0001" type="introduction">
      <title type="main">INTRODUCTION</title>
      <p>Earlier work tested this (Smith, <link href="#tst10101-bib-0001">2020</link>; Jones &amp; Lee, <link href="#tst10101-bib-0002">2019</link>), as Figure <link href="#tst10101-fig-0001">1</link> shows.<note xml:id="tst10101-note-1001"><label><sup>1</sup></label><p>A footnote in the text.</p></note></p>
    </section>
    <section xml:id="tst10101-sec-0002" type="materialsAndMethods">
      <title type="main">MATERIALS AND METHODS</title>
      <section xml:id="tst10101-sec-0003" type="experimental">
        <title type="main">Participants</title>
        <p>We tested 40 <fi>Rana dalmatina</fi> tadpoles (Table <link href="#tst10101-tbl-0001">1</link>). The code is at <url href="https://github.com/example/test">https://github.com/example/test</url>.</p>
        <p><computerCode><lineatedText><line>x &lt;- 1</line><line>y &lt;- 2</line></lineatedText></computerCode></p>
        <mathStatement numbered="no" xml:id="tst10101-mthst-0001"><title type="mathStatementName">H1</title><p>Tadpoles hide more when predators are near.</p></mathStatement>
      </section>
    </section>
    <section xml:id="tst10101-sec-0004" type="results">
      <title type="main">RESULTS</title>
      <p>Hiding increased, <i>t</i>(38) = 2.50, <i>p</i> = .017, and <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="inline" altimg="graphic/tst10101-math-0001.png"><mi>F</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6.25</mn></math>.</p>
      <p><displayedItem type="mathematics" xml:id="tst10101-disp-0001"><label>1</label><mediaResource href="graphic/tst10101-math-0002.png" alt="urn:x-wiley:12345678:media:tst10101:tst10101-math-0002"/></displayedItem></p>
      <figure xml:id="tst10101-fig-0001"><label>1</label><title type="figureName">FIGURE</title><mediaResourceGroup><mediaResource alt="image" href="graphic/tst10101-fig-0001-m.png" mimeType="image/png" rendition="webHiRes"/></mediaResourceGroup><caption>Mean hiding time of <i>R. dalmatina</i> per treatment.</caption></figure>
      <tabular xml:id="tst10101-tbl-0001" copyright="John Wiley &amp; Sons, Ltd"><label>1</label><titleGroup><title type="tabularName">TABLE</title><title type="main">Hiding time by treatment</title></titleGroup>
        <table frame="topbot"><tgroup cols="3"><colspec colname="col1" colnum="1"/><colspec colname="col2" colnum="2"/><colspec colname="col3" colnum="3"/>
          <thead><row><entry colname="col1" morerows="1">Treatment</entry><entry colname="col2" namest="col2" nameend="col3">Hiding (s)</entry></row><row><entry colname="col2">M</entry><entry colname="col3">SD</entry></row></thead>
          <tbody><row><entry colname="col1">Predator<link href="#tst10101-note-0001"><sup>a</sup></link></entry><entry colname="col2">12.1</entry><entry colname="col3">3.2</entry></row><row><entry colname="col1">Control</entry><entry colname="col2">8.4</entry><entry colname="col3">2.9</entry></row></tbody>
        </tgroup></table>
        <noteGroup xml:id="tst10101-ntgp-0002"><note xml:id="tst10101-note-0001"><label><sup>a</sup></label><p>Predator cue added.</p></note></noteGroup>
      </tabular>
    </section>
